Alembic migrations for the ScoreGuide database (schema changes and a few one-off data fixes).

From the repository root:

    uv run --directory backend alembic revision --autogenerate -m "message"
    uv run --directory backend alembic upgrade head

env.py reads DATABASE_URL and rewrites the db:5432 host to localhost:5432 outside Docker, so the
same URL works from the host and inside Compose. The deploy runs `alembic upgrade head` after
every push to main.
